cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its write-ups, please cite it as below. Code is MIT; prose is CC BY 4.0."
type: software
title: "Ancient algorithms, implemented"
abstract: >-
  Python implementations of algorithms from dated historical sources in
  India, Babylon, Greece, China, the Maya world and the Islamic world. Each
  module names its source and edition, and its tests run the worked examples
  the source gives, where it gives any.
authors:
  - family-names: Subrahmanya
    given-names: Prasad
    website: "https://prasad.tech"
version: 0.1.0
