url: "https://prasad.tech/ancient-algorithms/"
keywords:
  - history of mathematics
  - Indian mathematics
  - kuttaka
  - Aryabhata
  - extended Euclidean algorithm
  - Madhava series
  - Babylonian mathematics
  - YBC 7289
  - Chinese remainder theorem
  - Sunzi Suanjing
  - Qin Jiushao
  - chakravala
  - Pell's equation
  - Bhaskara II
  - katapayadi
